06.poster.avif?t=1752063653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592110/extras/02eb8913fd03bacf4d84d52b0b6ff006.webm?t=1752063653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE POWER OF TWO</strong></h2>One of the main features of Spirit of the Island is a 2-player cooperative mode, where you can do\u2026 everything together! All single-player mode features are available in online play, even the story! Do farming, grow crops and make delicious dishes, build a store and sell your produce to tourists, explore the vast Archipelago to find treasure, and discover the secrets of the tropical paradise together, no matter the platform or place, as Spirit of the Island features full crossplay between PC, Consoles and, starting form the end of Q1 2024, Mobile.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592110/extras/4406b3b43422f43b728c86771c6f983e.poster.avif?t=1752063653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592110/extras/4406b3b43422f43b728c86771c6f983e.webm?t=1752063653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A HISTORIC COLLECTION</strong></h2>Everything you stumble upon on your journey across the Archipelago is a relic of its own kind. Treasures that you find when going treasure hunting, various insects, various fish, even the new plants you grow \u2014 it\u2019s all a reminder of the amazing journey and your achievements. All these little bits and pieces are collected in the Museum: a place of wonder and magnificence. Will you find and unlock everything that the Archipelago has to offer and complete your ultimate collection?<br><br>Spirit of the Island is set to provide you with a unique and completely cross-platform mix of a farming sim and sandboxed adventure. And our DLC \u2014 Adventureland \u2014 will expand on the idea even more.",
